Lab: Troubleshoot and Scale Applications
Objective
Remediate a malfunctioning web application (Famous Authors) with a MySQL backend and HTML frontend by:
•	Identifying CPU-consuming pods.
•	Fixing failed pods.
•	Updating container images.
•	Configuring probes.
•	Scaling applications.
•	Setting resource requests and limits.
________________________________________
Step 1: Identify Problematic Pods
•	Use the web console → Observe → Dashboards → Kubernetes / Compute Resources / Namespace (Workloads).
•	Identify the pod or deployment consuming excessive CPU and remove or correct it.
________________________________________
Step 2: Fix Database Deployment (quotesdb)
•	Add missing environment variables:
oc set env deployment/quotesdb MYSQL_USER=operator1 MYSQL_PASSWORD=redhat123 MYSQL_DATABASE=quotes
•	Update to the new MySQL container image:
oc set image deployment/quotesdb mysql-80=registry.ocp4.example.com:8443/rhel9/mysql-80:1-237
•	Add readiness and liveness probes:
oc set probe deployment/quotesdb --readiness -- mysqladmin ping
oc set probe deployment/quotesdb --liveness -- mysqladmin ping
•	Set resource requests and limits:
oc set resources deployment/quotesdb --requests cpu=200m,memory=256Mi --limits cpu=500m,memory=1Gi
________________________________________
Step 3: Configure Frontend Deployment
•	Add readiness and liveness probes:
oc set probe deployment/frontend --readiness --get-url=http://:8000/status
oc set probe deployment/frontend --liveness --get-url=http://:8000/env
•	Set CPU and memory requests/limits:
oc set resources deployment/frontend --requests cpu=200m,memory=256Mi --limits cpu=500m,memory=512Mi
________________________________________
Step 4: Scale Applications
•	Scale the frontend deployment for high availability:
oc scale deployment/frontend --replicas=3
________________________________________
Step 5: Test Application
•	Use the route to test the frontend:
curl http://frontend-compreview-scale.apps.ocp4.example.com
•	Verify MySQL backend connectivity and correct responses from the UI.
________________________________________
Step 6: Lab Completion
•	Grade your work:
lab grade compreview-scale
•	Finish and clean up:
lab finish compreview-scale

